# Generated, never committed: renders, the films' sound, the synthesized sound kit.
*/out/
*.wav
*.mp4
sfx/
*/audio/stems/
# The sound library stays on the machine that made it (ElevenLabs' terms forbid passing its sound effects on as files
# or as a library): only what it asks for is kept. soundlib.mjs gen and build make the rest again.
sounds/*
!sounds/spec.json
# A film's tonal set: mix.mjs makes it again from the sheet's "tone" key.
*/audio/tone/
